2114
01:24:43,688 --> 01:24:44,787
- Yes! - That's right!

2115
01:24:44,788 --> 01:24:45,887
She's really lovely.

2116
01:24:45,888 --> 01:24:47,327
It was like watching "Park Gyeong Hye's Diary."

2117
01:24:47,328 --> 01:24:49,057
- Thank you. - It was so much fun.

2118
01:24:49,058 --> 01:24:50,898
You know, there are friends like this.

2119
01:24:51,098 --> 01:24:54,027
The friends who turn my day into a movie.

2120
01:24:54,028 --> 01:24:55,397
- Yes, there are. - My day...

2121
01:24:55,398 --> 01:24:58,338
