2122
01:24:58,468 --> 01:25:00,807
but it becomes dazzling thanks to this friend.

2123
01:25:00,808 --> 01:25:01,907
Right.

2124
01:25:01,908 --> 01:25:03,438
So I wanted to become close to her.

2125
01:25:03,838 --> 01:25:05,777
I'd love that. I like you so much.

2126
01:25:05,778 --> 01:25:07,777
(So I wanted to become close to her.)

2127
01:25:07,778 --> 01:25:10,448
Gyeong Hye, what are your plans going forward?

2128
01:25:10,578 --> 01:25:12,694
I'm going to wrap up the project I'm working on well.

2129
01:25:12,718 --> 01:25:13,877
There is still a lot of stuff to do.

2130
01:25:13,878 --> 01:25:16,317
There are still many things I need to take care of.

2131
01:25:16,318 --> 01:25:18,117
I'll take care of them 1 by 1,

2132
01:25:18,118 --> 01:25:21,528
