2133
01:25:21,588 --> 01:25:22,627
That's great.

2134
01:25:22,628 --> 01:25:25,797
We'll root for Gyeong Hye's single life full of energy...

2135
01:25:25,798 --> 01:25:27,768
- and positivity. - Thank you!

2136
01:25:28,168 --> 01:25:29,568
Thank you.

2137
